    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603930/extras/0c20846fc069c299be60f994e6f78692.poster.avif?t=1753201759\" width=800 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603930/extras/0c20846fc069c299be60f994e6f78692.webm?t=1753201759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603930/extras/0c20846fc069c299be60f994e6f78692.mp4?t=1753201759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dry Bones is a Platformer in which you control a Skeleton that is jumping, swinging and wallrunning to escape its dungeon! You will encounter many challanges like a minecard ride, or a flying broom course, but dont loose your head.... or should you? You will find mighty powerups like a doublejump or turnback of time in the form of alternative Heads to put on so stay alert, every level brings a load of new mechanics to the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603930/extras/3b90ae90a1ec1c03323fad6daeaf0624.poster.avif?t=1753201759\" width=500 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603930/extras/3b90ae90a1ec1c03323fad6daeaf0624.webm?t=1753201759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603930/extras/3b90ae90a1ec1c03323fad6daeaf0624.mp4?t=1753201759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Momentum based movement lets you pull of all sorts of tricks but the game is designed to be played for every skill level, there is much to explore in the 20+ Levels and much to collect!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603930/extras/2eaed1cdfe202cc49d886184e31c165d.poster.avif?t=1753201759\" width=500 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603930/extras/2eaed1cdfe202cc49d886184e31c165d.webm?t=1753201759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603930/extras/2eaed1cdfe202cc49d886184e31c165d.mp4?t=1753201759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603930/extras/0c20846fc069c299be60f994e6f78692.poster.avif?t=1753201759\" width=800 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603930/extras/0c20846fc069c299be60f994e6f78692.webm?t=1753201759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603930/extras/0c20846fc069c299be60f994e6f78692.mp4?t=1753201759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dry Bones is a Platformer in which you control a Skeleton that is jumping, swinging and wallrunning to escape its dungeon! You will encounter many challanges like a minecard ride, or a flying broom course, but dont loose your head.... or should you? You will find mighty powerups like a doublejump or turnback of time in the form of alternative Heads to put on so stay alert, every level brings a load of new mechanics to the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603930/extras/3b90ae90a1ec1c03323fad6daeaf0624.poster.avif?t=1753201759\" width=500 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603930/extras/3b90ae90a1ec1c03323fad6daeaf0624.webm?t=1753201759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603930/extras/3b90ae90a1ec1c03323fad6daeaf0624.mp4?t=1753201759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Momentum based movement lets you pull of all sorts of tricks but the game is designed to be played for every skill level, there is much to explore in the 20+ Levels and much to collect!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603930/extras/2eaed1cdfe202cc49d886184e31c165d.poster.avif?t=1753201759\" width=500 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603930/extras/2eaed1cdfe202cc49d886184e31c165d.webm?t=1753201759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603930/extras/2eaed1cdfe202cc49d886184e31c165d.mp4?t=1753201759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "A mysterious momentum based platformer! Easy to learn hard to master mechanics like wallrunning swinging and even riding a on magical broom! Exchange your head for weird powerups and collect all Skeleton Coins!",
